bledore  family i do take a bit of an issue with  the aberforth of it all  this is because everything that we know  about before dumbledore prior to this  film has suggested that he didn't really  how should i put this  like people  like at all in fact it's made quite  clear that he much rather preferred the  company of goats don't tell me you  didn't notice how he was looking at that  chilling anyway the only person he  seemed to ever really care for was his  little sister ariana as an adult after  she had died he was considerably gruff  to all who encountered him and yet we  are meant to believe that he fell in  love the same summer albus fell in love  with grindelwald what i find hard to  believe here is that aberforth had the  capacity for romance while caring for  his ailing sister as she still would  have been alive at least at the  beginning of the relationship the only  way i see this working is he fell in  love and then after ariana died he  looked for comfort from this woman the  only other person he cared for which  brings us to the question of who was  this woman beloved by one of the  wizarding world's most curmudgeony of  wizards here are a few ideas i've come  up with my most boring theory for who  amperforce lover was well hold on to  your pointy hats perhaps she was an  ordinary muggle who just happened to  live in godric's hollow at the same time  as the dumbledore family  see i warned you quite boring but  entirely possible she could have met  aberforth by chance one day in the  streets of the neighborhood or possibly  at a shop this theory would line up with  why credence was sent away to america as  the young lady may have been afraid that  her baby would be magical and therefore  a danger to her if it remained in her  care or perhaps her family discovered  the child's father aberforth was a  wizard and feared the baby so they sent  it away possibly against the mother's  wishes  and let's not forget even though  credence's adoptive mother mary lou  barebone referred to his biological  mother as a wicked unnatural woman which  obviously suggested she was a witch  mary lou would have been referring to  corvus le strange's mother clarice  tremblay as that was the woman who she  thought she had adopted from  but as we know from little lestrange's  confession in fantastic piece 2 lita  swapped corvus with credence on the ship  before it sank  this of course means that mary lou had  absolutely no clue who credence's real  mother was  now for the sake of the fantastic beast  storyline that last theory although  quite plausible seems rather unlikely  because it's not well shocking enough  from everything we've seen so far in the  fantastic beasts series i think it's a  lot more likely that we'll eventually  see some sort of plot twist come from  this mystery which in my opinion  means that it's a heck of a lot more  likely that aberforth's lover was from  some scandalous wizarding family not an  ordinary muggle one  one theory that i've heard is that  credence may be related to voldemort by  way of merope gaunt mother of voldemort  or tom riddle if you prefer while i  admit this would make a great twist i'm  pretty quick to discredit this theory  mainly due to the fact that myrapi was  born six years after credence making it  pretty difficult to be his mother  the gaunt family also resided in little  hangleton not godric's hollow where  aberforth and the mystery woman were  both living at the time of the romance  so if not the gaunt dynasty which  wizarding family could this mystery  wedge be from  after the crimes of grindelwald many  fans were convinced that credence was a  prince rather than a dumbledore the  prince family being the ancestors of  severus snape on his mother eileen's  side and while we obviously know now  that credence is indeed a dumbledore it  doesn't necessarily mean that he is not  a prince there is basically no known  information regarding the prince family  with the exception of eileen snape's  mother  what we do know is that eileen was born  around 1930  meaning that she is obviously not  queen's mother and severus's long-lost  brother  since as i've mentioned credence was  born in 1901  but this doesn't rule out that credence  was a prince on his mother's side  for example credence could have been her  father's cousin a secret son of one of  eileen's grandfather's sisters  that is if he had any obviously this is  all rather speculative as no one even  knows where the prince family resided  simply that they were british  which of course makes it possible that  they lived in godric's hollow alongside  the dumbledores so i guess this would  actually make miss prince if you will  the perfect candidate for credence's  mystery mother  since pretty much nothing is known about  the prince family in terms of canon it  provides plenty of room for a new story  to be written involving the new  characters from the fantastic beasts  franchise and let's face it who wouldn't  be super excited to learn that credence  was related to snape the parallels  between the two in terms of character  development are just too good should  they end up being actually related to  each other and let's not forget how  similar they look in appearance since  credence grew out his hair for more on  my theories on why these two wizards  look so much alike i recommend you check  out my previous video the next anti-hero  why credence looks like snape  so if credence's mother turns out to be  from the prince family will be left with  one final question  why was credence sent away to america as  an infant  perhaps the dumbledore family with their  father in azkaban and their sisters  ailing health and subsequent mysterious  death did not have the best reputation  and the prince girl was forced to give  up her baby by her family maybe because  aberforth and miss prince were so young  they thought it best to give their child  a better life with parents who were  ready or maybe miss prince and aberforth  were planning to run away to america to  raise their child on their own after all  we don't know who was traveling with  credence on the boat to america  and it was corvus who was destined for  an adoptive family  not credence credence may have been  traveling with his mother who died in  the boat which capsized with corvus  perhaps aberforth was meant to take a  later boat and join them only to learn  that they had died in the crossing or at  least miss prince and corvus had died  meaning that amber forth wouldn't have  known that his son was still alive  with that we have come to the end of  another video who do you think  credence's real mother is  why do you think he was sent to america  let me know your thoughts in the  comments below and as always if you  enjoyed this video don't forget to like  it and subscribe to the channel  until next time  if you listen carefully enough the past  whispers to you

